n_Rakath%27s_Gold\" title=\"Return Rakath's Gold\">Return Rakath's Gold</a></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/25px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/38px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/50px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png/25px-Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Portrait_Rakath_Glitterbeard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\">Rakath Glitterbeard</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlocks <b>High Security Vault nº9</b>  in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#The_Counting_House_-_High_Security_Vaults\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House - High Security Vaults</a>, which contains <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elegant_Studded_Leather\" title=\"Elegant Studded Leather\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elegant_Studded_Leather_Unf